  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[A7]\n[E5] [F#5] [G5] [A5] (x2)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[C#m]It's a disease, and they're all [E]green\n[G#m]It emanates from their [D#]being\n[C#m]A satiation, with [E]occupation\n[C#m]And like weeds, with big [E]leaves\n[G#m]Stealing light from what's [D#]beneath\n[C#m]Where they have more\n[E]Still they take more, [A7]mmmh\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[C#m]But I know, then I [E]don't\n[G#m]There's a stowaway with my [D#]throat\n[C#m]It's deceiving, I don't [E]believe him\n[C#m]We can scream, out our [E]doors\n[G#m]Behind the wall a fat man [D#]snores\n[C#m]In his dreams he's choking [E]tea leaves\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[A] [E]Well I guess\n[A] [E]There's nothing wrong with what you [D] [E]say\n[A] [E]But don't sell me,\n[A] [E]There can't be better [D]ways\n[A] [E]Tell the captain\n[A] [E]This boat's not safe and we're [D] [E]drowning\n[A] [E]Turns out he's the one making [D]waves\n[A]Waves, waves\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[E5] [F#5] [G5] [A5]\n[E5] [F#5] [G5]\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[A] [E]But I said\n[A] [E]There's nothing wrong with what you [D] [E]say\n[A] [E]Believe me, just asking you to [D]sway\n[A] [E]No white, or black, just [A] [E]grey\n[D] [E]Can you feel this\n[A] [E]World with your heart and not your [D]brain? [A7]\nBrain.\n\n{section: Outro}\n[E5]G [F#5]R [G5]E [A5]E D\n[E5]G [F#5]R [G5]E [A5]E D\n[E5]"
